					"nextDialogs": [
						400771140
					],
					"speakerTitle": "菲謝爾"
				},
				{
					"id": 400771140,
					"content": "換我來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400771141
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莫娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 400771141,
					"content": "親愛的先生，看著我。告訴我，你把手稿藏在哪裡了？",
